{
  "_comment": [
    "The regression suite's score for the reviewer on the commit named in corpus.source_commit,",
    "against the plantedbugs commit named in corpus.commit. `.github/scripts/regression-delta.mjs`",
    "reads a fresh run against it and prints what moved; a gated metric a change made worse fails",
    "the job.",
    "",
    "Thirty fixtures at one repeat, so thirty reviews. Every row is `value` (the fixture-level point",
    "estimate), `n` (the fixtures it was measured over), and the `threshold` and `direction` it is",
    "gated against, or nulls where the row is reported rather than gated. `meets` is whether the",
    "value clears its own threshold. Read the n before the value: P1 recall is measured over five",
    "fixtures, and two rows have an n of zero because the suite carries no fixture of that kind and",
    "because the reviewer cited no credential to redact.",
    "",
    "Recorded with `regression-delta.mjs --record` from run run_fc08423b4a78bd03 (2026-09-11,",
    "reviewer_v9, claude-opus-5 over claude-cli, routing d065). The corpus, reviewer, date and cost",
    "were filled in by hand: cost is the transport's own reported total. Re-recorded by hand, not by",
    "CI: see CONTRIBUTING.md."
  ],
